        "answer": {
          "short": "$[1,2):\\ 1;\\quad [2,4):\\ 4;\\quad [4,7):\\ 1.$",
          "worked": "Subtract consecutive cumulative frequencies.\n$$\\begin{align*}f_{[1,2)}&=1-0=1,\\\\f_{[2,4)}&=5-1=4,\\\\f_{[4,7)}&=6-5=1.\\end{align*}$$",
